  {
    "id": "blobs",
    "title": "Blobs",
    "kind": "emote",
    "tagline": "Google’s retired blob emoji, kept alive by Discord.",
    "lore": [
      "Google’s round, gummy blob emoji shipped with Android 4.4 KitKat in 2013 and were retired in Android 8.0 Oreo in 2017, replaced by circular faces for consistency across platforms.",
      "Fans didn’t let them go: the Blobmoji project and blob-themed Discord servers kept making new ones, Google brought them back as Gboard stickers in 2018, and the community added the blobcat along the way."
    ],
