  {
    "id": "cat-vibes",
    "title": "Cat Vibes",
    "kind": "emote",
    "tagline": "Head bobs, stares and very small dances.",
    "lore": [
      "catJAM is a white cat (reportedly named Minette) bobbing its head to Jonas Blue’s “I Wanna Dance”, from a TikTok posted in April 2020. Cut out as a transparent emote that July, it became chat’s universal “this song slaps”.",
      "The rest of the pack is the extended cat cinematic universe: vibing, staring, kissing and dancing cats, mixed from 7TV and emoji.gg."
    ],
